sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 用户
    participant Web as React Web
    participant API as Go API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Control as C++ Control
    participant Agent as C++ Agent
    participant Target as 目标进程
    participant Store as COS / MinIO
    participant Worker as Analyzer Worker

    Agent->>Control: 注册、心跳、能力与进程快照
    Control->>DB: 更新 Agent 与 ProcessSnapshot
    User->>Web: 选择 Agent、进程和 TaskKind
    Web->>API: GET Agent 能力与最新进程快照
    API->>DB: 查询权威快照
    API-->>Web: 可执行 TaskKind 与候选进程

    User->>Web: 提交采集任务
    Web->>API: POST /api/tasks + Idempotency-Key
    API->>DB: 校验权限、能力、PID 身份与预算
    API->>DB: 事务写 Task + Event + Attempt
    API->>Control: CreateTask(task_id, target, deadline)
    Control->>DB: 确认调度并持久化队列
    API-->>Web: 202 Accepted + task_id

    loop Agent 心跳拉取
        Agent->>Control: HealthCheck / Collect
        Control-->>Agent: TaskDesc 或无任务
    end

    Agent->>Agent: 再校验 PID/start_ticks/namespace
    alt 目标身份改变或策略拒绝
        Agent->>Control: FAILED + 稳定错误码
        Control->>DB: Task/Attempt/Event = FAILED
    else 允许执行
        Agent->>Target: 运行白名单 Collector
        Target-->>Agent: 原始采样数据
        Agent->>Store: 上传 RAW + SHA-256 + Manifest
        Agent->>Control: NotifyResult(artifact metadata)
        Control->>DB: Collection SUCCEEDED，Analysis QUEUED
        Worker->>DB: SKIP LOCKED 领取 AnalysisJob 租约
        Worker->>Store: 下载 RAW
        Worker->>Worker: 解析、聚合、生成报告
        Worker->>Store: 上传 RESULT
        Worker->>DB: Analysis SUCCEEDED，Task DONE
    end

    DB-->>API: 持久化事件游标
    API-->>Web: SSE 状态事件
    Web->>API: GET task / artifacts
    API-->>Web: 结果元数据与短期预签名 URL
    Web->>Store: 按授权读取结果产物
